Versioning
==========

VERSION and CHANGELOG reflect the status of the branch ide-plugins
in the repository sdv_doc_waterloo at github.

Whenever we increase the version in one of the packages
* pygments
* vscode
we should increase the version number here as well. There
is no automatic version bumping currently.


Packaging and Installation
==========================

The root directory contains the well-known script gather.sh
which copies all relevant files from ide-plugins (which is
governed by svn) to package_ide-plugins (which is governed
by git).

Pygments
--------

For pygments simply install like

cd package_ide-plugins/pygments
pip install .


VSCode
------

For VSCode build a package:

cd package_ide-plugins/vscode
npx @vscode/vsce package

and install as described in README.md,
e.g. from the directory:

code --install-extension package_ide-plugins/vscode/*.vsix

